# Read by BuildKit for self-host/Dockerfile (the context is the repository
# root). A developer's secrets never enter the image: the settings reach the
# container only through self-host/.env, mounted at run time.
**/.dev.vars
**/.dev.vars.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.wrangler
self-host/built-origin
self-host/built-name
self-host/wrangler-version
